---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withSiteName } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title={withSiteName('Privacy Policy')} description="How this independent guide handles browser storage, optional analytics, maps and weather." path="/privacy/"><section class="section"><div class="wrap prose max-w-4xl"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1 class="serif text-5xl font-bold">Privacy Policy</h1><p><b>Updated 21 October 2026</b></p><h2>Using this guide</h2><p>This independent information site has no accounts, booking or payment service, contact form, or published project email. Our hosting provider processes ordinary web-request information, such as IP address and requested URL, to deliver and protect the site. We do not set a separate retention period for provider operational logs.</p><h2>Hosting performance measurement</h2><p>Cloudflare, our hosting provider, may independently add Cloudflare Web Analytics to measure page-load performance and timing. This hosting measurement operates separately from optional Google Analytics and is not controlled by the Google Analytics choice on Cookie Settings. See Cloudflare’s <a class="link" href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/data-metrics/data-origin-and-collection/">data collection documentation</a> and <a class="link" href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/faq/">Web Analytics FAQ</a> for how it works.</p><h2>Optional Google Analytics</h2><p>Google Analytics loads only after an explicit opt-in. Advertising features are disabled. The <a class="link" href="/cookies/">Cookie Settings</a> page applies withdrawal immediately to the Google Analytics runtime and remembers your choice in localStorage where available. Granting consent again updates the same runtime without loading a second library. If storage fails, the choice applies now and denial is kept in this tab where possible; persistence in a new tab or browser cannot be guaranteed.</p><h2>Maps, weather and images</h2><p>Google Maps is a separate embedded service. Weather requests go from your browser to Open-Meteo forecast and marine services for the viewpoint coordinates; we do not request your device location. These providers receive ordinary request information, including your IP address, under their own policies. Weather results may be cached in sessionStorage for up to 30 minutes, and are not used for advertising. Site photographs are served from this site's own image files.</p><p><a class="link" href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google privacy policy</a> · <a class="link" href="https://open-meteo.com/en/terms">Open-Meteo terms and privacy</a> · <a class="link" href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Hosting provider privacy policy</a></p><h2>Your controls</h2><p>You can reject Google Analytics, clear browser storage, or block third-party requests in your browser. Clearing the site preference removes the saved choice and Google Analytics defaults to off. Weather or map availability does not control access to the visitor guide.</p><h2>Changes</h2><p>The date above identifies the policy revision. Third-party services and their policies can change; consult the linked providers for their current practices.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
